 r←Test_YesOrNo_002(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "YesOrNo" with default parms. Should return "Cancel".
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.CreateParmsForYesOrNo
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.autoPress←##.GUI.Enums.Buttons.Cancel
 →FailsIf 0≠myGuiParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Dialogs.YesOrNo'Are you really sure about this?'

 r←∆OK
